{
  "name": "Flyer",
  "type": "archetypes",
  "img": "icons/svg/statue.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>The best way to support your team is from the air.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers/Qualities</div><p>Assign one of the dice you rolled at the end of the power source step to the @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.5GDEdsr0jrDmWApP]{Flight} or @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle} power. If you already have one of them, either skip it or swap the die with one of your new dice.</p><p>Assign one or more remaining dice to any of these powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>• Select from Mobility powers category</p><p>• Select from Technological powers category</p><p>Assign any remaining dice to any of these qualities:</p><p>• Select from Information qualities category</p><p>• Select from Physical qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of the following Green abilities, at least one using your @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.5GDEdsr0jrDmWApP]{Flight} or @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle} power:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.jQeGha5op3hKKYZP]{Aerial Bombardment}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.ohMZL0W6ozgMBkhA]{Aerial Surveillance}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.2ys5Zh6b6Qe7334k]{Barrel Roll}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.jx3t1QKTAaoY2GGH]{Dive & Drop}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.gp3fCpIguE2mdpIs]{Sonic Boom}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.dwhE1ddwSw4rU5Lg]{Strike & Swoop}</li></ul><p>Gain one of the above abilities at Yellow.</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.AJyBzxZH4WjXrNBj]{Aerial Bombardment}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.kjKxLCwTYiuhcm0O]{Aerial Surveillance}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.R37Loo71GMm7OeRm]{Barrel Roll}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.VKHVrynlFCNDHUvG]{Dive & Drop}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.Y5UohFe4r7xiLBhq]{Sonic Boom}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.5FCzlWuUil09s2Gx]{Strike & Swoop}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose an Ideals principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Personality</div><p>Roll d10, d10 for personality selection.</p></section>"
  },
